# Loragent deployment rule

- Trigger all production deploys via **Mission Control** (https://mission-control.lorapok.tech), not GitHub Actions UI.
- Use **Infra** mode for admin + website without marketplace publish.
- Marketing site URL: **https://loragent.lorapok.tech**
- Admin panel URL: **https://mission-control.lorapok.tech**
- Skills: `loragent-unified-deployment`, channel skills (`loragent-amo-publish`, `loragent-openvsx-publish`, `loragent-vscode-publish`).
